# 🇮🇳 15. The Citizen's Responsibility

One of the most interesting consequences of reading these stories is that they can make you ask:

> **"What is my responsibility as a citizen?"**

Not everyone serves through the military.

But everyone can contribute through:

* Integrity
* Responsible citizenship
* Helping others
* Respecting service members
* Educating themselves
* Building useful skills
* Contributing to society
* Doing their own work honestly

Service takes different forms.

